<title>GERMANY: German 1996 motor vehicle production up 4 pct-VDA.</title>
<headline>German 1996 motor vehicle production up 4 pct-VDA.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German VDA Automobile Industry Association published the following data for 1996 motor vehicle production.</p>
<p>			    1996		   pct change vs yr ago</p>
<p>PRODUCTION</p>
<p>    Cars		  4,539,400	    + 4 pct</p>
<p>Trucks up to</p>
<p>    six tonnes	  190,700		+ 10 pct</p>
<p>    Other trucks	113,300		- 15 pct</p>
<p>    Total		 4,843,400	    + 4  pct</p>
<p>EXPORTS</p>
<p>    Cars		  2,649,900	    + 7  pct</p>
<p>Trucks up to</p>
<p>    six tonnes	  123,500		+ 26 pct</p>
<p>    Other trucks	68,000		 - 10 pct</p>
<p>    Total		 2,841,400	    + 8  pct</p>
<p>			    December 1996	pct change vs yr ago</p>
<p>PRODUCTION</p>
<p>    Cars		  315,300		 - 1  pct</p>
<p>Trucks up to</p>
<p>    six tonnes	  14,500		  + 6  pct</p>
<p>    Other trucks	9,500		   - 17 pct</p>
<p>    Total		 339,300		 - 1  pct</p>
<p>EXPORTS</p>
<p>    Cars		  193,500		 unch</p>
<p>Trucks up to</p>
<p>    six tonnes	  10,300		  + 34 pct</p>
<p>    Other trucks	7,300		   unch</p>
<p>    Total		 211,100		 + 1  pct</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
